{
  "dataset": "Lifestyle factor (生活型態因子) controlled vocabulary",
  "policy": [
    "Canonical life.* factor ids (D17). Hierarchical dot ids group related factors under one stem (life.sleep.*, life.caffeine.*, life.nicotine.*, life.diet.*) so a card or intake form can ask 'which sleep factors' without a second lookup table; a handful of factors (alcohol, exercise, sedentary_time, hydration) stand alone at life.* because they do not cluster under an existing stem.",
    "觀察到的生活型態資料是一筆觀察值，不是診斷：任何程式路徑都不得將 life.* 觀察自動轉為 TCM 證型或病名（D17 §6）。此清單只提供可勾選的因子與其量化建議欄位，推論仍須由臨床人員判斷。",
    "疑似暴露（suspected）不得自動升級為確診（confirmed）——本檔案不涉及暴露分級，量表定義見 exposure_vocabulary.json。",
    "value_hint_en on every record suggests HOW to capture the quantity (cups/day, hours/night, current/former/never + amount/day + years, …). It is a UI hint, not a stored value — the actual number lives on the case observation, not on this vocabulary.",
    "IDs are ASCII (D10). Adding a factor is a schema change: this file, then the intake form, then any validator that checks life.* ids."
  ],
  "created": "2026-08-12",
  "applies_to": "Case-level lifestyle observations captured under a future life.* field",
